<title>UK: New Zealand sets $100 million one-year bond.</title>
<headline>New Zealand sets $100 million one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HER MAJESTY THE QUEEN IN RIGHT OF NEW ZEALAND</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     4.875     MATURITY    09.DEC.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    09.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    UNLISTED  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  35 BP     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
